    ===========================================
      README file for the `JOCO' GAP4 package 
     ===========================================

JOCO is a GAP 4 package for computing with rainbows and Jordan configurations.
It is an extension of the COCO2P package and JOCO requires that COCO2P is installed.

The following persons contributed in various ways in the creation of
JOCO:
	Mikhail Klin,
	Christian Pech (maintainer),


The newest verion of JOCO is available from github.

From whithin gap4 you can load coco2p by issuing the command:
     LoadPackage("joco");

Help about JOCO can be obtained from inside gap 4 using the command
     ?joco
     


